Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:06:48.14,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 华盛顿 WTA500 半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:06:48.14,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs38}6-4 6-2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 大坂直美 · 赛后演播室专访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,uh binabatita.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, salamai salama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:06.72,EN,,0,0,0,,They've been teaching me a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们教了我几个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,of Tagalog words
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,他加禄语的词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:10.72,EN,,0,0,0,,while I was. Congratulations not just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:10.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,趁我在这儿 恭喜你 不只是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,on making your second career final,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进生涯第二个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:14.56,EN,,0,0,0,,but on doing it against an iconic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,更是因为对手是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,opponent like Naomi Osaka,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,大坂直美这样的标志性球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:17.76,EN,,0,0,0,,former world number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,前世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I would imagine you'd be pretty proud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想这样的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.24,EN,,0,0,0,,of that performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,会让你挺自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm super proud of my performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 我为自己的表现非常自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think I played really well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and I had a great mentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,心态也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and I stayed locked in to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我一直专注到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Can I assume
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我能不能这么猜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:32.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that you grew up watching Naomi Osaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是看着大坂直美长大的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Because I I wonder what it felt like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我很好奇那是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:36.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to be out there for the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一次站到球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:37.84,EN,,0,0,0,,on the opposite side of the net
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,在球网的另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,from a her power, but but b her aura
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,面对她的力量 还有她的气场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:42.40,EN,,0,0,0,,because she has one, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:42.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是有那个东西的 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:44.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, she does. She definitely has aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 她确实有气场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:46.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and she definitely has power,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,她的力量确实很强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这我可以作证
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且是的 我是看着她的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I I remember watching her, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我记得看过她的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.88,EN,,0,0,0,,her finals in in the Australian Open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,她在澳网的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:54.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and also in the US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有美网的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,So, um really a great experience to share
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以能和她同场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.12,EN,,0,0,0,,the court with her and I'm really happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的是很棒的经历 我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:01.28,EN,,0,0,0,,that I was able to to produce
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己能打出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:02.32,EN,,0,0,0,,that level against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,面对她的这种水平
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:02.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,you generated 12 break points today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天创造了 12 个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:05.68,EN,,0,0,0,,returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,在接发球上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,You were able to break
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你还破掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.12,EN,,0,0,0,,her massive serve four times in this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,她那么强的发球 这场破了四次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,You've rapidly become one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你很快就成了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.36,EN,,0,0,0,,of the elite returners in women's tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,女子网坛顶尖的接发球手之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I wonder what your mental thought process
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想知道你脑子里在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:17.92,EN,,0,0,0,,is as you step up to the baseline
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,当你站到底线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:19.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to return serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,准备接发球的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:21.04,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you telling yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会对自己说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:22.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Are you saying, "Okay, just get it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不是在说 先接进去就行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Just get it in with depth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,接进去 打深一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Attack. Be aggressive." What What's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,进攻 主动一点 到底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.76,EN,,0,0,0,,the mental thing that you're telling yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会对自己说些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,as you get ready to return?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,在准备接发的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh it it really depends on the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真的要看当下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.64,EN,,0,0,0,,because there are so many factors
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为接发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:34.56,EN,,0,0,0,,when it comes to returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,要考虑的因素太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Um you know, what's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在是什么局面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:38.56,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you looking for in the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想在这一球上找什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,And at the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且说到底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.28,EN,,0,0,0,,you don't know what serve is going to come
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道会来一个什么发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:42.00,EN,,0,0,0,,at you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So you kind of have to be ready
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以你得做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:45.12,EN,,0,0,0,,for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,应对任何情况
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,But I think whatever well I try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我想 我尽量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to do best what I can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,把能控制的做到最好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:53.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So whatever I can control I try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,只要是我能控制的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to do my 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就做到百分之百
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,It's well known that you started training
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家都知道你开始训练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:58.88,EN,,0,0,0,,at the Nadal Academy on Mallorca
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,是在马略卡的纳达尔学院
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,when you were 12 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,那年你 12 岁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:01.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm curious what
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:04.08,EN,,0,0,0,,is the the the primary thing that rubbed off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,那段时间留在你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:05.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on you from your time there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,最主要的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Is it something that's in your strokes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是体现在击球上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,something tactical,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是战术层面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.48,EN,,0,0,0,,or is it something just kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,又或者只是那种
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of the fighting spirit that that Rafa instills
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,拉法在那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,in in everybody around that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,灌输给每个人的战斗精神
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What what's what's the thing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:19.28,EN,,0,0,0,,that you take away from there the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,让你从那儿带走最多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,It's hard to pinpoint one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难只挑出一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:22.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I've been there for a really long time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在那儿待了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and and I you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I spent a lot of my formative years there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我成长最关键的那几年都在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I've made so many great relationships
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我建立了很多很好的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and of course the staff
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然还有那里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and the coaching staff and the staff
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,教练团队 还有整个团队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,at the academy are so knowledgeable,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,学院里的人都非常懂行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:36.56,EN,,0,0,0,,so experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,经验也非常丰富
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So I learned and of course Rafa himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我学到很多 当然还有拉法本人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.36,EN,,0,0,0,,uh I've learned so many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我学到了太多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:47.52,EN,,0,0,0,,well if you think I I left at 13 and now I'm 21.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:47.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想 我 13 岁离开 现在 21 岁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So how much has improved from then
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么从那时算到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:51.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,进步了多少
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:54.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I think you know tactically, physically,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想战术上 身体上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:58.00,EN,,0,0,0,,technically um So many aspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,技术上 方方面面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:02:58.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:02:58.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:00.40,EN,,0,0,0,,We saw you both yesterday at the end
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,昨天赛后我们看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:01.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of the match and then again today
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天赛后又看到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,at the end of the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,同样一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Go over to Joan Bosch
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你走向若安·博世
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and give him a big hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,给了他一个大大的拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Just just tell us what what he has
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟我们说说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:08.16,EN,,0,0,0,,your relationship with him is like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:08.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你和他是什么样的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and and how much he's meant
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,他对你的成长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to your development.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh Joan, he's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,若安 他是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,He's the best and he's uh I trust him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,他最好了 我在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,so so much on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常非常信任他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Um yeah, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh yeah, I trust him so much with my tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我把网球完全交给他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and low key just in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,说真的 生活上也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:28.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I I be telling him everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我什么都跟他说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:29.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:32.40,EN,,0,0,0,,it makes me feel like I'm not alone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这让我觉得自己不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,on court along with the rest of my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上 还有我整个团队
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I think all of us have that dedication
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们每个人都有那份投入
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:41.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and and that drive for us to improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:41.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,和想变得更好的那股劲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I would think of all the people on tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得整个巡回赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,you would feel the least alone on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你应该是最不孤单的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You're you're never alone on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在场上从来不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:49.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, so the final tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:49.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:50.72,EN,,0,0,0,,against Jessica Pegula,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手是佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.00,EN,,0,0,0,,which will be a rematch
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一场重赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.48,EN,,0,0,0,,from last year's Miami semifinal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,去年迈阿密半决赛的重赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:56.24,EN,,0,0,0,,when you were outside the top 100
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,那时你还在前 100 之外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:57.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and made this amazing move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出了那波惊人的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:59.28,EN,,0,0,0,,You still stretched her to three sets
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你还是把她拖进了三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,in that match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那场比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:00.80,EN,,0,0,0,,How are you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:00.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,18 个月过去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:03.76,EN,,0,0,0,,a different player uh 18 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你成了一个什么样的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,as you get ready to play Jess again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,又要和她交手了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:08.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Good question. I think I'm I would say
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,好问题 我想说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,if I compare myself now to then,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果拿现在和那时比
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:12.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm more well-rounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我更全面了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:15.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I'm physically a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体上也好了一些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I've I've improved on a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有几项技术
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.32,EN,,0,0,0,,of my strokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,都提高了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:19.84,EN,,0,0,0,,what's the what's the one you've improved
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,那你觉得哪一项
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:23.04,EN,,0,0,0,,the most, would you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,提高得最多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I think maybe my forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想可能是正手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I would say my forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,应该是正手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Serves also improved quite a bit I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球我觉得也提高了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:36.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Um but I would say that everything all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我会说所有方面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.48,EN,,0,0,0,,the aspects have kind of improved
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,都在提高
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:42.16,EN,,0,0,0,,at the same you know same pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且是同样的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:45.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Um but then again each player
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过话说回来 每个球员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:46.64,EN,,0,0,0,,is always evolving
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,都在不断进化
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:47.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know improvement
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:47.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且进步
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:50.64,EN,,0,0,0,,is not a linear it's not a linear thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,从来不是一条直线
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:51.52,EN,,0,0,0,,No it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:51.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So every match is different
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以每一场都不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:55.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and and I'm sure Jess has also changed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:55.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我相信她也变了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,so much in these 18 months like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像你说的 这 18 个月里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:04:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So it's going to be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:04:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以会是一场好球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,You're a very humble, very
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是一个非常谦逊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:01.76,EN,,0,0,0,,self-effacing young champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常不张扬的年轻冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:04.40,EN,,0,0,0,,How do you stay grounded in the midst
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这一切当中你怎么保持
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,脚踏实地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,You know what you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你懂我意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,It it you've got
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你肯定会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:11.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to feel like you you've got to you got
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,多多少少
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,to feel like a little bit of a rock star
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,觉得自己有点像摇滚明星
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,when this is what follows you around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,毕竟到哪儿都这个阵仗 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,It's I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,真说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:21.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I think
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:23.84,EN,,0,0,0,,um Sorry, I lost my train of thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我忘了要说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:28.48,EN,,0,0,0,,No. Yeah. I think that um Well, for one,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:30.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I still have so much motivation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还有那么强的动力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,to become a better player,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,想成为更好的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.52,EN,,0,0,0,,become a better person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,也想成为更好的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:38.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm 21, so it's not like, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我才 21 岁 又不是说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm the queen of the world or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是什么世界女王
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:40.88,EN,,0,0,0,,but um
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,all evidence to the contrary, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有证据都指向相反的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I think uh another thing is that tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有一点 网球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:48.48,EN,,0,0,0,,is such a humbling sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,是一项让人谦卑的运动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Um another thing is I look back
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有就是我回头看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,at how far I've come or where I've come
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,看自己走了多远
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:55.76,EN,,0,0,0,,from and and I've come a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,从哪儿走过来 走了很长的路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:56.48,EN,,0,0,0,,That's another thing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:57.36,EN,,0,0,0,,that keeps me grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我脚踏实地的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:58.08,EN,,0,0,0,,There are so many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的东西太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.76,EN,,0,0,0,,My family keeps me grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的家人让我脚踏实地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:02.08,EN,,0,0,0,,My team keeps me grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的团队让我脚踏实地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:03.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Every error I hit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在场上打丢的每一球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court keeps me grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,都让我脚踏实地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Every time I'm mad
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在场上每一次生气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.04,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court keeps me grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,都让我脚踏实地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Um when I wake up in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,早上起床
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I have bad hair keeps me grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,头发乱糟糟 也让我脚踏实地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, so many things
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你看 有那么多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,that keep you grounded and and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,都能让人踏踏实实
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:18.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like these people,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,they're they're here with me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们在这儿陪着我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:22.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and and of course they're here for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然也是为我而来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but more than that old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但不止于此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:28.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:30.32,EN,,0,0,0,,congratulations on a groundbreaking win
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你拿下这场里程碑式的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:31.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and we look forward to seeing you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们期待明天看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:33.76,EN,,0,0,0,,in the final tomorrow against Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,在决赛里对阵佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:35.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:38.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex Eala.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Our final is set in DC
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,华盛顿的决赛就此定下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and she says she may not be the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,她说自己也许不是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:44.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么世界女王
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:48.14,EN,,0,0,0,,It kind of seems like she is, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:48.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,但看起来还真有点像
